{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_08",
  "title": "黃沙盡頭",
  "storyCode": "AS-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "adbe26abec5ba45fd3790d28e0d8963c9cc897527752d819726171efd8efe050",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert03_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這是在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——喔，是我的啟程儀式！我一定是跳舞跳得太開心，把自己轉昏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開朗的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_163",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞，我祝福你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開朗的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_163",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認識的一支商隊會定期前往那座輝煌之城，你如果真的走到了那裡，就去找他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，我就知道你那裡總有可用的人脈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多一個朋友，少一樁麻煩，謝啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶疑的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞，我還是很擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擔心什麼？我說了多少次了，我不在，大家也不會來報復你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一切都跟你無關。你轉投我手下，是我有魅力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿西姆那老傢伙為此怨恨我，到處說我的壞話，是他小氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後嫉妒我的人湊到一起，對我設圈套壞我好事……就怪我運氣好，太招金子喜愛也太招人喜愛吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶疑的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，娜仁圖亞，我擔心的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶疑的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要這樣行囊空空地走進沙漠，如果找不到水源也遇不到野獸，該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？我們每個人的錢袋是都比以前空了不少，但也不至於落魄到連肉乾和果脯都準備不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你怎麼會這麼想的？難道說你們有人偷偷吃了苦不告訴我？誰？\n我現在就拿點金幣出來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜仁圖亞的手在腰上的錢袋裡摸了摸。\n然後，她緩緩瞪大了眼睛，解下獸皮袋，翻過來抖了抖。\n幾粒沙子落進了無邊的大漠之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，我不記得自己遇到過乞丐或者流浪漢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒是隱隱約約記得，遇到了不少有錢人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶疑的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞，我想了想，應該把我尋找水源的祕訣教給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猶疑的前沙盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，我沒必要再擔心自己會被一個暴徒首領選中當犧牲品了，也就不用捏著一個關係所有人生死的獨門訣竅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——好，我喜歡這個祝福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就讓那幾枚金幣隨流沙而去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞，我也很擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，你又擔心什麼？我再從車上劫一個奴隸小孩回來，搶走你的識字數量倒數第一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我擔心你的那兩把黑刀，很久沒用過了，也沒有護理過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是因為護理麻煩，我才一直不用那兩把老古董。我寧可崇拜現代材料和機器鍛造——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我的刀呢？我的匕首呢？我儲備的麻痺毒劑和孢子瓶呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，娜仁圖亞，我擔心的確實是你總想招攬新的手下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你獨自出發，如果遇到的是能立刻給你幫助的手下，那的確很好，但大多數時候，其實是像我和阿雅吉那樣被你救……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“獨自出發”？你們不跟我一起去那座“輝煌之城”了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我和阿雅吉去雨林的伐木場做了兩個月的工，把存起來的金幣全部丟進了一條據說會流到輝煌之城的河裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願你能在河水漫上來的時候撿到它們，但願你的天途能更加順利……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我也喜歡這份祝福，雖然雨林在河的下游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天途？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，天途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞，你已經準備好了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有啊，什麼時候的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……現在我的確是“孤身一人，除了父母所贈予的武器之外身無一物”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那我還是不去輝煌之城了。不去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年輕的夢魘轉頭大步走向自己的馱獸隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert03_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剎那間，黃沙中立起高牆，刺眼的陽光彷彿被抹除一塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我的馱獸呢？我的帳篷呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "娜仁圖亞揉了揉眼睛。\n彷彿陷入自己製造的夢魘，她的視野逐漸收窄，只剩下一條筆直向前的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要啊！這天途太恐怖了！會死的啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救命啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g17_deserttown_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪。這裡的構裝人偶一動不動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人倒在那裡？你好，還聽得到嗎？撐住，我這就來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g17_deserttown_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛就這麼躺在地上，有一隻巨大的循獸用爪子踩著我的頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認為那是一隻循獸，但我沒來得及抓住牠，牠就消失在沙塵之中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難怪我在夢裡感覺頭有點痛，還有個聲音“嗚嗚”地跟我說話。我臉沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎麼趕走那隻循獸的？我在夢裡跟牠大喊大叫了半天都沒說服牠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考慮到情況緊急，我直接使用了暴力手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我怎麼沒想到？有時候還是刀子好用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道你是個可靠的手下，多謝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說錯了，不是手下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們還是快走吧。這些金屬人偶隨時可能再動起來，這裡並不安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我來說倒是滿安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，河中的神靈明明給了我見義勇為展示自我的機會，我怎麼就在大街上睡著了呢……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還做了個好夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……街上一片混亂，你躺在沙子裡，還……做了個好夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我夢見了自己的啟程儀式，很熱鬧，連大家打的拍子都特別整齊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當初說準備來米納特哈瑪儀的時候，要是以前的手下真的那麼支持我，那該多好啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你離開旅館之後，我和阿雅吉阿雅妮聊了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們是不是也跟你說，大部分人都覺得我在做白日夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是啊，反正夢總要醒，為什麼不夢個最好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許我們都還有很多對方不了解的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很高興得知你平安無事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯帕齊婭向娜仁圖亞伸出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們就算和好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿雅妮，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞！救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博物館根本！一點！也不安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g4_ctizengarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緹緹，你剛才說話了嗎……？我有點耳鳴……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……而且我也聽到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。不是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些文物會說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇……它們之前為什麼不說啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永恆的守護者，請回答，請回答，請回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回答什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他教跑船的外鄉人從這裡開始下地行走，他用黃金佩刀的軍隊保護訪客魯莽的好奇心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他杯中的甘甜與苦澀皆從過客囊中榨取，他腳下的沙粒埋著遙遠西北的骨片與焦石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提醒我，他在世間留下的“名”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……阿娜特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得它們並不算“會說話”，至少不算能溝通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們只是會提出謎題——就像你開保險庫的時候要輸入密碼一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可、可是！哪有這麼複雜的謎語？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石構裝體",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1488_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒數計時，三分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這下我們把它變成定時炸彈了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——等等，阿娜特，冷靜一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還能聯絡到博物館員工嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得，說不定這是關於歷史的謎題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得……你不是最喜歡那本《大地巡旅》了嗎？書在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "緹緹，麻煩幫我翻到二百五十一頁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你問的是貝爾德帕夏，他同意了開拓伊比利亞—薩爾貢—玻利瓦爾省商道，繼而引進了玻利瓦爾省的甘蔗與咖啡豆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“與大地之膿瘡共生，纖小的頭顱串在皮革腰帶上齊聲哀鳴”……\n根據標籤，應該在六十二頁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是沙地獸。六世紀時薩爾貢北部曾有捕獵沙地獸的風潮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前館藏中用成串沙地獸頭顱製成的驅邪裝飾，一向被我們認為是無端的自然崇拜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……見證過歷史的你們其實一直都知道，捕獵沙地獸的起因是高濃度活性源石環境引起的少量沙地獸變異，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，下一位構裝體，下一個問題，請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“湖底的遺跡，先祖繁衍百代的子嗣，子嗣斬斷先祖的頭顱”……\n這個不用找標籤了，我記得就在第一百頁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那是考古中的一個謎題，一個千年前古代聚落的住民被集體處決，發掘出的刑具卻使用了近代的合金材料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但答案就寫在這裡。幾乎無人親眼見過的一個種族，匹特拉姆，自古以來就傳承著獨特的冶煉鍛造技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，下一題……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隨著書頁翻動，構裝體的謎語一一得到正確解答，它們的躁動也漸漸平息。\n被停下的構裝體圍在阿娜特身邊，像一圈沉默的聽眾。\n阿娜特想起自己第一次上台演講之前，緹緹教自己把觀眾看成博物館裡的文物，這樣就不會緊張。\n“你只要堅持講自己覺得正確的事情，阿娜特。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唔，這是個受忌諱的說法，但薩卡茲的確曾經踏足薩爾貢。我們至今不知道古老的詛咒留存在多少歷史注腳裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，緹緹，這也是你給我的啟發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？詛咒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只是一直不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩爾貢有文字記錄的歷史已經能夠上溯到其他國家一片蠻荒的史前時代，你選擇離開薩爾貢遊學，又能看到什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才翻開了《大地巡旅》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到，在有限的生命裡，我們對這片大地的誤會和偏見太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們能擁有的最大勇氣，就是窮盡短暫的生命，向無限的時間求索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我們又不是永恆的守護者，沒辦法親歷一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，要是有這樣一個機會，你想像祖拜爾那樣長生，親眼見證更久遠的歷史嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我一直在想，這些構裝體在透過歷史問答來認證，我們是不是有資格控制它們的那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，是哪句話觸發了它們的認證模式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerId": "avg_4139_papyrs_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個人究竟是懷著什麼樣的心情，將關鍵口令選擇為——“哈拉赫特”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好黑……這是在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……在那隻怪獸的肚子裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g16_desertoasis"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "風的聲音……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……前面是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙漠中的湖泊……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在金黃的沙漠中，一片碧綠色的湖泊正躺在中央，微風輕輕拂動岸邊的棕櫚樹，發出佩佩方才聽到的樹葉摩挲的聲音。\n一個男孩半截身子潛入水中，片刻後，他忽然坐起身，手裡緊握著一條漂亮的金色鱗。\n他捧著鱗，小心翼翼地向佩佩走來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個……小朋友，請問你知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，看我捉到了什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，誰是你姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你在亂說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親說，他打算將母親埋在這裡，埋在她的故鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他還會為她修建一座漂亮的墳墓，有漂亮的水池，種滿蓮花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會將這條金色的小鱗留在那方水池中，牠會代替我陪伴母親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這和我有什麼關係嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要再叫我姐姐了！我弟弟跟你長得不一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親……他的征伐仍然要繼續，他不會因為母親的離開停下腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他問我們，是要留在這裡的行宮還是跟著他繼續往東方行進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……小朋友，你在說什麼？我一點也聽不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想要和父親一起抵達東方，去見識、去征服更加遙遠的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我一起走吧，姐姐，帶上你的莎草紙卷與燈芯草筆，你會遇到很多很多值得記述的東西，我會像父親一樣，成就一番偉業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會成為你筆下的主人公！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的男孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和我一起走吧，姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，小朋友，容我婉拒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會與你一同跟隨父親，祖拜爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佩佩回過頭去，看到一個女孩手持白色的蓮花，額頭上的蓮花金飾在陽光下閃閃發光。\n這枚額飾讓女孩覺得熟悉，她輕輕摸上自己的額頭。\n那一刻，陽光讓她覺得目眩。"
    },
